1075 #edb/ref 17592186404515 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404511 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404516 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404511 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404511 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404511 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186404513 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404511 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "7222ce8b-9f86-5907-ac8e-304c68fbadee" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404512 #edb/ref 1080 "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}-2{R}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+3{R}_{3}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404512 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404512 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2b9183d1-23e9-5f90-a209-d6b19d245c52" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404513 #edb/ref 1080 "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+2{R}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}-3{R}_{3}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404513 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404513 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "226f3fd1-f941-5569-80fa-d157db347e67" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404514 #edb/ref 1080 "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+2{R}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+3{R}_{3}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404514 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404514 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3b46698e-ccc1-5f9f-8f8c-b005abd4b4b1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404515 #edb/ref 1080 "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}-2{R}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}-3{R}_{3}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404515 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404515 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3a4bce52-0e47-55a1-ac84-7a9f035eef89" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404516 #edb/ref 1080 "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+3{R}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}-2{R}_{3}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404516 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404516 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "38987e9b-2b2d-5194-a0c2-03820aac76b3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404988 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186404989 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404988 #edb/ref 1069 "q-99055" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404988 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404988 #edb/ref 1071 "What are the critical points of the function $f(x)=\\frac{x-3}{{x}^{2}-5}?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404988 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "63c773de-f51b-54ba-8cf5-768e0048eb88" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404988 #edb/ref 1074 "A critical point of $f(x)$ is a point $x=c$ in the domain of $f$ such that either ${f}^{′}(c)=0$ or ${f}^{′}(c)$ does not exist.\n\nDifferentiating $f(x),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{x-3}{{x}^{2}-5}) \\\\  & =\\frac{(x-3)^{′}\\cdot ({x}^{2}-5)-(x-3)\\cdot ({x}^{2}-5)^{′}}{({x}^{2}-5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({x}^{2}-5)-(x-3)\\cdot 2x}{({x}^{2}-5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-5+6x-{x}^{2}}{({x}^{2}-5)^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{x}^{2}-6x+5}{({x}^{2}-5)^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now proceed to find the critical points:\n\n- First, we compute the points where ${f}^{′}(c)=0.$ We set the derivative equal to zero, and solve for $x$ by completing the square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{{x}^{2}-6x+5}{({x}^{2}-5)^{2}} & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-6x+5 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-2\\cdot 3x+{3}^{2}-{3}^{2}+5 & =0 \\\\ (x-3)^{2}-9+5 & =0 \\\\ (x-3)^{2}-4 & =0 \\\\ (x-3)^{2} & =4 \\\\ x-3 & =\\pm 2 \\\\ x & =1,\\,5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)$ has stationary points at $x=1$ and $x=5.$\n\n- Second, we note that ${f}^{′}(x)$ does not exist at $x=\\pm \\sqrt{5}.$ But these points do not lie in the domain of $f(x).$ So $f(x)$ has no non-stationary critical points.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the critical points of $f(x)$ are $x=1$ and $x=5.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404989 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404990 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404989 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404991 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404989 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404992 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404989 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404993 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404989 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404994 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404989 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404989 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404989 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186404994 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404989 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "25281d74-3b09-5c83-b4d4-d24247da42a5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404990 #edb/ref 1080 "$x=3$ only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404990 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404990 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3099f3c2-846b-5ae3-b13d-62bf2853c8e6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404991 #edb/ref 1080 "$x=1$ only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404991 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404991 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "80bf0b4b-0794-5476-96ae-6da113dacb97" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404992 #edb/ref 1080 "$x=3$ and $x=\\sqrt{5}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404992 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404992 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1d2185e2-fc3d-5abf-9cc2-33c57fd4ee19" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404993 #edb/ref 1080 "$x=1$ and $x=3$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404993 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404993 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "4278a543-dfc0-5d1f-b8c7-13dc3aeb961d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404994 #edb/ref 1080 "$x=1$ and $x=5$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404994 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186404994 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7ea262a0-90f2-5ce8-828c-598aa9e08bf9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186406895 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{6}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186406895 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186406895 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5b4c000b-c921-5509-a96b-cb9f0d93c9ec" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17